    "headline": "High Wind Warning issued October 16 at 5:10AM PDT until October 17 at 12:00PM PDT by NWS San Diego CA",
    "description": "* WHAT...Northeast winds 25 to 35 mph with gusts 50 to 65 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Santa Ana Mountains and Foothills.\n\n* WHEN...Until noon PDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Damaging winds will blow down trees and power lines.\nPower outages are possible. Travel will be difficult, especially\nfor high profile vehicles.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Winds will be strongest this afternoon through\nearly evening.",
    "instruction": "People are urged to secure loose objects that could be blown around\nor damaged by the wind.",
